/span><span begin="01:08.599" end="01:15.244">run</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.496" end="01:26.056"><span begin="01:17.496" end="01:17.767">You </span><span begin="01:17.767" end="01:18.127">bathe </span><span begin="01:18.127" end="01:18.463">in </span><span begin="01:18.463" end="01:18.847">your </span><span begin="01:18.847" end="01:20.776">victory </span><span begin="01:21.631" end="01:21.888">you </span><span begin="01:21.888" end="01:22.271">blew </span><span begin="01:22.271" end="01:22.631">out </span><span begin="01:22.631" end="01:22.999">all </span><span begin="01:22.999" end="01:23.713">my </span><span begin="01:23.713" end="01:25.159">fuse</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.056" end="01:34.424"><span begin="01:26.056" end="01:26.216">And </span><span begin="01:26.216" end="01:26.376">if </span><span begin="01:26.376" end="01:26.712">I </span><span begin="01:26.712" end="01:27.095">took </span><span begin="01:27.095" end="01:27.504">on </span><span begin="01:27.504" end="01:27.896">the </span><span begin="01:27.896" end="01:28.976">planet </span><span begin="01:29.608" end="01:29.816">will </span><span begin="01:29.816" end="01:30.152">I </span><span begin="01:30.152" end="01:30.543">pay </span><span begin="01:30.543" end="01:30.959">my </span><span begin="01:30.959" end="01:32.776">dues</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.424" end="01:43.232"><span begin="01:34.424" end="01:34.729">Your </span><span begin="01:34.729" end="01:35.136">love </span><span begin="01:35.136" end="01:35.536">was </span><span begin="01:35.536" end="01:35.888">a </span><span begin="01:35.888" end="01:37.576">mystery </span><span begin="01:38.712" end="01:38.984">yeah </span><span begin="01:38.984" end="01:39.312">my </span><span begin="01:39.312" end="01:39.688">love </span><span begin="01:39.688" end="01:40.072">is </span><span begin="01:40.072" end="01:40.784">a </span><span begin="01:40.784" end="01:42.232">fool</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.2